#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`crc` --- CRC Computation"
msgstr ":mod:`crc` --- CRC izračun"

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``crc`` module computes CRC16 and CRC32 checksums over byte-like "
"buffers. Each function may be called with only ``data`` to start a new CRC, "
"or with a previous ``value`` to continue an existing CRC across multiple "
"buffers."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``crc`` izračunava CRC16 i CRC32 kontrolne sume nad međuspremnicima "
"nalik bajtovima. Svaka funkcija može se pozvati samo s ``data`` za "
"pokretanje novog CRC-a, ili s prethodnom ``value`` za nastavak postojećeg "
"CRC-a kroz više međuspremnika."

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:12
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:21
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:25
msgid ""
"Computes a CRC16 checksum over ``data``, which must be a buffer-like object "
"(e.g. ``bytes``, ``bytearray``, or ``memoryview``)."
msgstr ""
"Izračunava CRC16 kontrolnu sumu nad ``data``\\ , koja mora biti objekt nalik"
" međuspremniku (npr. ``bytes``\\ , ``bytearray`` ili ``memoryview``\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:28
msgid ""
"If ``value`` is not provided, a new CRC16 is started over ``data`` and "
"returned. If ``value`` is provided, it is used as the previous CRC16 state "
"and updated with ``data`` before being returned, allowing CRC16 computation "
"across multiple buffers. Only the lower 16 bits of ``value`` are used."
msgstr ""
"Ako ``value`` nije navedena, pokreće se i vraća novi CRC16 nad ``data``\\ . "
"Ako je ``value`` navedena, koristi se kao prethodno CRC16 stanje i ažurira "
"se s ``data`` prije nego što se vrati, što omogućuje izračun CRC16 kroz više"
" međuspremnika. Koristi se samo donjih 16 bitova vrijednosti ``value``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:34
msgid "Returns the resulting CRC16 as an ``int``."
msgstr "Vraća rezultirajući CRC16 kao ``int``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:38
msgid ""
"Computes a CRC32 checksum over ``data``, which must be a buffer-like object "
"(e.g. ``bytes``, ``bytearray``, or ``memoryview``)."
msgstr ""
"Izračunava CRC32 kontrolnu sumu nad ``data``\\ , koja mora biti objekt nalik"
" međuspremniku (npr. ``bytes``\\ , ``bytearray`` ili ``memoryview``\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:41
msgid ""
"If ``value`` is not provided, a new CRC32 is started over ``data`` and "
"returned. If ``value`` is provided, it is used as the previous CRC32 state "
"and updated with ``data`` before being returned, allowing CRC32 computation "
"across multiple buffers."
msgstr ""
"Ako ``value`` nije navedena, pokreće se i vraća novi CRC32 nad ``data``\\ . "
"Ako je ``value`` navedena, koristi se kao prethodno CRC32 stanje i ažurira "
"se s ``data`` prije nego što se vrati, što omogućuje izračun CRC32 kroz više"
" međuspremnika."

#: ../../library/omv.crc.rst:46
msgid "Returns the resulting CRC32 as an ``int``."
msgstr "Vraća rezultirajući CRC32 kao ``int``\\ ."
